  "book": "1CO",
  "chapter": 13,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "marker": "p",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "engylt_usfx.xml#book[@id=\"1CO\"]/p[31]",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "1",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.1",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "If with the tongues of men and of messengers I speak, and have not love, I have become brass sounding, or a cymbal tinkling;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.1"
        },
        {
          "verse": "2",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.2",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "and if I have prophecy, and know all the secrets, and all the knowledge, and if I have all the faith, so as to remove mountains, and have not love, I am nothing;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.2"
        },
        {
          "verse": "3",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.3",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "and if I give away to feed others all my goods, and if I give up my body that I may be burned, and have not love, I am profited nothing.\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.3"
        },
        {
          "verse": "4",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.4",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "The love is long-suffering, it is kind, the love doth not envy, the love doth not vaunt itself, is not puffed up,\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.4"
        },
        {
          "verse": "5",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.5",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "doth not act unseemly, doth not seek its own things, is not provoked, doth not impute evil,\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.5"
        },
        {
          "verse": "6",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.6",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "rejoiceth not over the unrighteousness, and rejoiceth with the truth;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.6"
        },
        {
          "verse": "7",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.7",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "all things it beareth, all it believeth, all it hopeth, all it endureth.\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.7"
        },
        {
          "verse": "8",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.8",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "The love doth never fail; and whether [there be] prophecies, they shall become useless; whether tongues, they shall cease; whether knowledge, it shall become useless;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.8"
        },
        {
          "verse": "9",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.9",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "for in part we know, and in part we prophecy;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.9"
        },
        {
          "verse": "10",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.10",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "and when that which is perfect may come, then that which [is] in part shall become useless.\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.10"
        },
        {
          "verse": "11",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.11",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "When I was a babe, as a babe I was speaking, as a babe I was thinking, as a babe I was reasoning, and when I have become a man, I have made useless the things of the babe;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.11"
        },
        {
          "verse": "12",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.12",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "for we see now through a mirror obscurely, and then face to face; now I know in part, and then I shall fully know, as also I was known;\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.12"
        },
        {
          "verse": "13",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.13",
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "and now there doth remain faith, hope, love — these three; and the greatest of these [is] love.\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "1CO.13.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "1CO.13.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "1CO.13.13"
        }
      ]
    }
